        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Before marketing in the U.S., any drug that we develop must undergo rigorous pre-clinical testing and clinical trials and an extensive regulatory review and approval process implemented by the FDA under the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act (FDCA) and, in the case of biologics, the Public Health Service Act.",
