        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The patent rights that we own or have licensed relating to our product candidates are limited in ways that may affect our ability to exclude third parties from competing against us if we obtain regulatory approval to market these product candidates.",
